### 4. Learning Zone — Topic-Oriented Games

#### [MODIFY] [LearningZoneScreen.tsx](file:///e:/KTUfy_Project/ktufy-frontend/KTUfy/screens/LearningZoneScreen.tsx)

- **Remove** Word Scramble and Math Sprint "Coming Soon" sections (lines 413-439)
- **Add** a topic input field at the top
