### 8. Library — Needs Decision

> [!IMPORTANT]
> You mentioned students already use **KTU Assist** for notes. The current Library uploads/downloads documents via Supabase Storage — essentially duplicating what KTU Assist does.
>
> **Options:**
> - **A. Remove** Library from Explore (since KTU Assist exists) — but it's in the bottom tab bar
> - **B. Repurpose** Library as a personal notes/bookmarks section (save important links, annotate topics)
> - **C. Keep** Library as study material uploads (your own platform, not KTU Assist)
>
> **Which direction do you prefer?** This affects whether Library stays in the bottom tab bar.

