## Verification Plan

### Manual Testing (via Expo Go on device)

Since this is a React Native/Expo app, all verification will be done manually on device:

1. **Group Study → WhatsApp:** Tap the card → should open WhatsApp group invite in browser
2. **PYP hidden:** Verify the grid shows 9 cards (not 10) and PYP is gone
3. **AI Flashcards:** Enter a topic → verify flashcards are generated and swipeable
4. **Learning Zone:** Verify Word Scramble & Math Sprint are removed; existing games still work
5. **Schedule:** Verify exam schedule loads from backend (or shows error/loading state if backend is down)
6. **Syllabus:** Verify syllabus loads from backend with real content displayed in-app

The app is already running via `pnpm exec expo start`. Changes will hot-reload automatically.
